# A3-HF2 derivation: the grandfather clock's strike and the fountain's redraw cadence
# ULTIMA.EXE / overlays from original/u5/ultima5 (git-ignored). Offsets: CS (dis16 --exe) unless noted.
# Mnemonics only: the opcode-byte column is stripped (no EA bytes are committed).
# Tools: re/tools/dis16.py; re/tools/a3_hf2_ds_census.py (every instruction naming DS:<addr>, FILE offsets; ULTIMA.EXE code = file - 0x800).

