## 3. Census: every reference to DS:0x5884 (the strike counter) in ULTIMA.EXE and all *.OVL
## (positive control: 0x4a62/0x4b0e/0x4b23 are the known readers/decrement in ambient_sfx_tick 0x4262/0x430e/0x4323)
